      "Fix": "End instead on the unresolved image of the fifth thing Kyle refuses to put away \u2014 the lowered blade, the broken promise, the soldier who trusted it \u2014 held in silence at the doorway before he crosses to Pixel\u0027s, so the last beat is the cost he\u0027s keeping rather than the meal that lets him set it down."
